(  LINE EDITING COMMANDS                           WFR-790105 ) : R                          ( REPLACE ON LINE #-1, FROM PAD *)       PAD  1+  SWAP  -MOVE  ;                                                                                                   : P                           ( PUT FOLLOWING TEXT ON LINE-1 *)       1  TEXT  R  ;                                                                                                             : I                       ( INSERT TEXT FROM PAD ONTO LINE # *)       DUP  S  R  ;                                                                          CR                                  : TOP                    ( HOME CURSOR TO TOP LEFT OF SCREEN *)       0  R#  !  ;                                               -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             